WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:01.434
♪ (UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.302
I think it's important
to move...

00:00:03.869 --> 00:00:07.107
<i> a little bit, every day.</i>

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.042
Stretch.

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:12.212
Yeah!

00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:16.316
What?

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.720
Welcome to<i> Painting with John</i>
season two.

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.190
<i> The show where I do not
 teach you how to paint.</i>

00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:27.460
When season one
of the show came on,

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:30.963
I got so many people saying,
"Oh, you live in paradise,

00:00:31.063 --> 00:00:32.332
<i> you are so lucky."</i>

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.336
And I'm just thinking,
"It is paradise.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.739
But we didn't show you
the bad stuff."

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:42.509
Our washing machine...

00:00:43.976 --> 00:00:45.912
<i> During the rainy season,
 there's these</i>

00:00:45.978 --> 00:00:47.179
<i> little gnat things.</i>

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:50.149
They don't sting you like a bee
'cause you rattled its nest,

00:00:50.616 --> 00:00:52.952
they just sting you
'cause they're mean.

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:54.354
(GNAT BUZZING)

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:56.322
The horror.

00:00:56.756 --> 00:00:58.491
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:03.596
How do you like my boots?

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:05.932
<i> I haven't been sleeping,
 so I have</i>

00:01:05.998 --> 00:01:07.500
<i> these dark circles
 under my eyes.</i>

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:10.136
And I imagine that somebody
would be flicking

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:12.738
through the channels and go,
"Honey,

00:01:13.038 --> 00:01:15.474
there's a talking raccoon
on this channel.

00:01:15.908 --> 00:01:17.043
And he's painting."

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.079
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:21.914
<i> I have to be
 completely candid,</i>

00:01:22.414 --> 00:01:25.317
I have these conversations
in my head when I'm painting.

00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:28.153
We shot the first season,
and all these reviews are,

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:30.156
"I'd like to hang out
with John Lurie sometime.

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:32.691
<i>He seems like a good person
 to have a beer with."</i>

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:35.795
<i> But nobody who knows me
wants to hang out with me.</i>

00:01:38.064 --> 00:01:39.532
<i>Life can be pretty horrible.</i>

00:01:41.667 --> 00:01:43.736
<i> But there are also
 beautiful moments.</i>

00:01:45.571 --> 00:01:48.108
I believe that human beings
should shine.

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:51.778
<i> Shine from within.</i>

00:01:53.045 --> 00:01:56.149
There's no ending to this story,
so...

00:01:58.951 --> 00:02:00.153
Thank you!

